eligibility_summary:
Current members of the Royal Historical Society who are early career historians (within 5 years of submitting a corrected PhD in a historical subject). Applications are assessed on the quality of the proposal, taking the applicant's financial circumstances into account.

Normally resident in the UK;
Not in full-time permanent academic employment, be this a non-tenured or open-ended contract;
Please note that current doctoral students are not eligible for this scheme, and should consider other RHS schemes of financial support which are running as normal.
Applicants who have previously been awarded an ‘Early Career Fellowship Grant’ will not be eligible for further funding under this scheme.
